{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#card-zh","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 是一个面向 DSH Web 的多实例管理插件，在设置页和页面侧边栏集中展示本机及远程 Harness。它通过 DSH Web API 探测实例状态，并可在页面内切换到远程实例；还支持配置本机角色、启动和管理实例、浏览本机或远端历史会话，以及启用只读 Fleet 网关。适合同时使用多台 DSH Web 主机、需要查看运行状态或续读旧会话的用户。跨设备读取会话和远程重启需要配置共享令牌；网关默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1220-1226","lib/index.js:1230-1242","client/client.js:1705-1714","lib/index.js:850-889"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#card-en","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fleet brings local and remote DSH Web instances into one dashboard. It shows status, switches to remote pages, and lets users browse session history. Cross-device reading and remote restart use a shared token; its optional read-only gateway is disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1220-1226","lib/index.js:1230-1242","client/client.js:1705-1714","lib/index.js:850-889"]}
