{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#feature-1","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 的功能「实例状态面板」：在 Web 页面展示本机和已登记远程 DSH 的在线状态、版本信息及忙闲状态。打开面板或触发扫描即可更新状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:354-390","lib/index.js:1170-1185","client/client.js:959-960"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#feature-2","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 的功能「远程实例切换」：从侧边设备栏选择已登记的远程 Harness，在当前页面内嵌打开其界面，也可另开页面或刷新远程页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1660-1703"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#feature-3","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 的功能「跨设备会话浏览」：在会话面板列出本机或远程实例的历史会话，并展开查看对话内容；远端读取通过共享令牌授权。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:847-881","lib/index.js:1434-1484","client/client.js:1550-1630"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#feature-4","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 的功能「Fleet 只读网关」：可在设置中开启独立 HTTP 监听端口，让同一网络的其他实例通过共享令牌读取会话索引和会话内容。默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:850-889","lib/index.js:865-884"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#caveat-1","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 使用前须知：跨设备读取会话和远程重启依赖本机配置的共享令牌；未设置令牌时会话服务不可用。（见 lib/index.js:77-86, 671-684）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-86","lib/index.js:671-684"]}
{"unit_id":"loveXbanshee__dsh-fleet#caveat-2","repo":"loveXbanshee/dsh-fleet","commit":"1619060ea904625d1a7ac50595c669fa70b571be","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fleet 使用前须知：启用自托管 Fleet 网关会在所选主机和端口监听；默认绑定 0.0.0.0:33180 且默认关闭，只有令牌已设置时才会启动。（见 lib/index.js:77-86, 850-889）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-86","lib/index.js:850-889"]}
